    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_connected_v_n_info_eq_classes" kindref="compound">ConnectedVNInfoEqClasses</ref> - Helper class that can divide VNInfos in a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_live_interval" kindref="compound">LiveInterval</ref> into equivalence clases of connected components. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_live_interval" kindref="compound">LiveInterval</ref> that has multiple connected components can be broken into multiple <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_live_intervals" kindref="compound">LiveIntervals</ref>.</para>
<para>Given a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_live_interval" kindref="compound">LiveInterval</ref> that may have multiple connected components, run:</para>
<para>unsigned numComps = ConEQ.Classify(LI); if (numComps &gt; 1) { // allocate numComps-1 new <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_live_intervals" kindref="compound">LiveIntervals</ref> into LIS[1..] ConEQ.Distribute(LIS); } </para>
    </detaileddescription>
